Code ported from other projects
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

OpenAI Whisper (https://github.com/openai/whisper), MIT, Copyright (c) 2022 OpenAI
  - src/mel.rs: the log-mel front end of whisper/audio.py `log_mel_spectrogram` (n_fft 400, hop 160, periodic Hann
    window, centred STFT with reflect padding, last frame dropped, power spectrum, log10 clamped to max - 8, then
    (x + 4) / 4) and its 16 kHz / 30 s constants.
  - src/model.rs: the encoder-decoder architecture of whisper/model.py (two conv1d + GELU stem, pre-norm transformer
    blocks, learned positions, tied output embedding) and the special-token prompt (<|startoftranscript|>,
    <|notimestamps|>), implemented in burn. Tensor names follow the Hugging Face Transformers checkpoint layout
    (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/huggingface/transformers); no Transformers code is included.

librosa (https://github.com/librosa/librosa), ISC, Copyright (c) 2013--2023, librosa development team
  - src/mel.rs `mel_filters`: the Slaney-scale, Slaney-normalized mel filter bank of librosa.filters.mel (the
    matrix Whisper ships as mel_filters.npz), computed here instead of loaded.
